.TH VMSPLICE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
vmsplice \- Linux x86-64 syscall 278
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B ssize_t vmsplice(int descriptor, const struct iovec* vectors, unsigned long count, unsigned int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Maps or copies user buffers into a pipe.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vmsplice (2)
